OL,3,GNEWSAThree cleared of illegal dog
OL,4,Abreeding and fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been found not guilty
OL,7,Fof illegal dog breeding and fraud after
OL,8,Fthe prosecution offered no evidence
OL,9,Fagainst them.
OL,11,FOne of the three, Euros Davies, 61,
OL,12,Ffrom Cwmsychpant, is the member for
OL,13,FLlanwenog on Ceredigion County Council.
OL,15,FEuros Davies, along with Rhydian
OL,16,FDavies, 29, from Prengwyn and Delyth
OL,17,FMathias, 30, from Cardiff, previously
OL,18,Fpleaded not guilty to the charges
OL,19,Fagainst them.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
