OL,3,GNEWSAThree cleared of illegal dog
OL,4,Abreeding and fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn December, Thomas John Jones, 28,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to participating in a
OL,8,Ffraudulent dog breeding business
OL,9,Fbetween March 2015 and November 2023.
